[h1]R.A.T.S. Keel[/h1]
[i]R.A.T.S. – Reconnaissance, Acoustics, Terrain & Signals[/i]

[b]Keel keeps your modded game afloat.[/b]
The mod loader for Sea Power: starts your code mods, checks each one against your game version first, and tells you what happened.

[quote]▶ [b]Replaces[/b] Anchor Chain and Alpine's Mod Loader: Keel is all you need
▶ [b]Watch:[/b] [url=https://youtu.be/m66tiCyWSNw]Install[/url] · [url=https://youtu.be/JrRR7d8NbhU]When a mod breaks[/url] · [url=https://youtu.be/vc_UddZHn0g]Switch from Anchor Chain or Alpine[/url]
✉ Bugs, ideas, questions: [url=https://hub.sewerlabs.dev/s/keel]R.A.T.S. feedback board[/url]
⭐ A favourite helps other captains find it[/quote]

[h2]✦ New in 0.5[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Keel takes over.[/b] Anchor Chain's and Alpine's loaders no longer start while Keel is on: every mod starts once
[*][b]What's new since your last game.[/b] A card on the main menu shows updated, new and broken mods, with their authors' notes
[*][b]Euromod stages.[/b] The report names your stage, a button switches Extended Guidance
[*][b]Cards that get out of your way.[/b] A right click hides them, they fade on their own
[*][b]Start early[/b] for mods that need it (mod makers opt in, see below)
[/list]

[h2]✦ Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Your mods keep working.[/b] Anchor Chain mods and BepInEx plugins run as they are, no new versions needed
[*][b]Checked before they start.[/b] A mod made for another game version is caught before it can stop missions from loading
[*][b]One failure, not a crash.[/b] Every mod starts on its own; a broken one is marked and the rest go on
[*][b]A crash window that names the mod.[/b] Tick a box to keep it off, restart
[*][b]The report.[/b] Ctrl+Shift+K: every mod, running or not, and why
[*][b]Bug reports in one click.[/b] Save logs or Send report, your Windows user name removed
[*][b]Restart from the Mods menu.[/b] Saves your list, restarts the game
[/list]

[h2]▶ Quick start[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe
[*]Run [b]KeelSetup.exe[/b] from Keel's Workshop folder: Steam, right-click Sea Power, Manage, Browse local files, then up to [i]steamapps\workshop\content\1286220\3835527459[/i]. It adds BepInEx if needed; [b]Restore[/b] undoes everything
[*]Start the game, switch R.A.T.S. Keel on in Mods, restart once
[/olist]
[list]
[*][b]Loaded?[/b] The Keel card sits at the bottom left of the main menu; a click opens the report
[*][b]While mods start[/b] the loading window counts them: best not to click around in the game meanwhile
[*][b]Windows says "unknown publisher"?[/b] The file is not signed yet: More info, Run anyway
[/list]

[h2]⚠ Good to know[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Changes nothing[/b] in the game, missions or saves: it decides which code mods start, in which order
[*][b]Other loaders' files stay as they are.[/b] Switch Keel off and they start again
[*][b]Euromod, the AC Pack and its add-ons[/b] run under Keel as they are
[*][b]Can't stop[/b] a crash inside the game engine or a graphics driver; it names what it knows
[/list]

[h2]⚙ Install and game versions[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Run in the game on 0.9.1[/b] (build 261112): 43 mods, Euromod with AC Pack and Extended Guidance in a mission, Alpine kept out
[*][b]0.8.7 (flat map):[/b] run with an earlier version; keep Anchor Chain subscribed there
[*][b]By hand, settings, how it works:[/b] [url=https://github.com/struckl/SeaPowerKeel]README on GitHub[/url]
[/list]

[h2]⚙ For mod makers[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]List R.A.T.S. Keel as your required item.[/b] Your players need no Anchor Chain item and no manual install
[*][b]Loads as built:[/b] [ACPlugin] and [BepInPlugin] mods, their dependencies and ACConfig
[*][b]Start early:[/b] [Keel] StartEarly=true in your _info.ini starts your mod before the load screen ends
[*][b]Reports that say what broke:[/b] the missing method, field or type after a game update
[*][b]Details:[/b] [url=https://github.com/struckl/SeaPowerKeel/blob/main/docs/for-mod-authors.md]for mod authors[/url]
[/list]

[h2]✉ Problems, feedback, ideas[/h2]
